  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Chart-specific inputs and validation for all 34 chart types. Gauges require an explicit maximum independent of their current value and support grouped needles; bullets use explicit actual and target calculations. Missing calculations remain gaps or show a notice, never invented zero values. Adds optional split fields, concentric donut breakdowns, time-based bar races, sequential pie animation, sparkline tables and specialized polar layouts. Preserves legacy overall metrics and network definitions. Combination series configure types and axes inline; tables retain columns and headings. No public/mobile contract or storage schema changes. Uses Core and Contracts 1.0.4; pair with Server 1.0.6 for PostgreSQL hosts.",
